{"ticker":"GPPL","symbol":"GPPL","instrumentId":3113700,"name":"Gujarat Pipavav Port","industry":"NSE-Real Estate Dvlpmt/Ops","about":"Gujarat Pipavav Port Ltd. operates one of India’s leading multi-purpose ports, strategically located on the southwest coast of Gujarat. The port offers a comprehensive range of cargo handling services, including container, bulk, and liquid cargo. Its modern infrastructure, deep draft berths, and seamless connectivity to India’s major industrial and agricultural hubs make it a vital gateway for international trade. The port is well-integrated with road and rail networks, facilitating efficient cargo movement across northern and northwestern India. As part of APM Terminals, Gujarat Pipavav Port leverages global expertise in port operations, ensuring high standards of service and reliability.","website":"www.pipavav.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:24:22.316Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":178.28,"changePct":2.037545787545789,"week52High":193.34,"week52Low":142.39},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹8,619 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,280 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"270,726,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"235"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"175,595,012"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"4.49%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.61"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.04"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"23%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"15.64"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"13–33"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"21.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"10.56"},{"label":"Volume","value":"651,849"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,353,587"},{"label":"Master score","value":"59"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"74"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"71"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"33"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating